flowchart LR
  DEV[Pull request] --> STATIC[Docs, format, lint, type, schema checks]
  STATIC --> UNIT[Unit, rule, auth, adversarial tests]
  UNIT --> INT[Ephemeral adapter integration tests]
  INT --> GOLDEN[Deterministic golden regression suite]
  GOLDEN --> SEC[Secret, dependency, SBOM, image, and IaC scans]
  SEC --> PLAN[Terraform validate and speculative plan]
  PLAN --> REVIEW{Review and checks pass?}
  REVIEW -- No --> DEV
  REVIEW -- Yes --> BUILD[Build once and sign immutable artifacts]
  BUILD --> ECR[ECR image digest and release manifest]
  ECR --> STAGE[Deploy to staging]
  STAGE --> SMOKE[Migration, contract, E2E, accessibility, golden canary]
  SMOKE --> APPROVE{Protected production approval}
  APPROVE -- No --> HOLD[Hold release]
  APPROVE -- Yes --> PROD[Rolling or blue-green production deployment]
  PROD --> BAKE[Observe bake window and synthetic canary]
  BAKE --> HEALTH{Gates healthy?}
  HEALTH -- Yes --> DONE[Promote release record]
  HEALTH -- No --> ROLLBACK[Rollback image and configuration manifest]

  OIDC[GitHub Actions OIDC and least-privilege roles] -. authenticates .-> STAGE
  OIDC -. authenticates .-> PROD
  PAID[Protected scheduled paid-provider evaluation] -. supplies approved AI evidence .-> APPROVE
